["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/InspectionAction", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "An inspection action refers to a specific activity or set of activities performed during an inspection to examine, verify, or evaluate an item, process, or system.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
